{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09490","headline":"信州录事参军常曾古鼎歌 · 韦应物","name":"信州录事参军常曾古鼎歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年纠一郡，独饮寒泉井。\n江南铸器多铸银，罢官无物唯古鼎。\n雕螭刻篆相错盘，地中岁久青苔寒。\n左对苍山右流水，云有古来葛仙子。\n葛仙埋之何不还，耕者枪然得其间。\n持示世人不知宝，劝君链丹永寿考。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}